{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2023-01-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES PRICES $400 MILLION OF 5.250% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2032', 'text': 'DENVER , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED A PUBLIC OFFERING OF $400 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.250% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2032. THE PRICE TO INVESTORS WAS 99.883% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES.'}